# Unreal-generated folders and IDE files (regenerated on each machine)
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
.idea/
*.xcworkspace
*.xcodeproj
*.sln
*.code-workspace
.vscode/
# Greybox maps and imported Fab kit meshes: generated by Tools/build_greybox.sh (about 230 MB, kept out of LFS)
Content/Greybox/
# Third-party packs (the Elite Bundle: Scansfactory, Dekogon, Meshingun) are licensed and large: never commit them.
# Their Unreal packs must sit at Content/<PackName> to keep their internal references, so ignore every Content folder except ours.
/Content/*
!/Content/BIB/
!/Content/Weather/
# The owner's Elite_Bundle store assets: copied in by Tools/import_elite_bundle.sh (about 2 GB, kept out of Git and LFS)
Content/Elite_Bundle/
# The bb-Showreel motion pack in game form: built by Tools/import_motion_pack.sh from the owner's motion-studio folder (2026-10-09)
Content/BIBMotion/
Content/Movies/
Art/MotionPack/source/projects/
